# Build output and runtime state.
target/
data/

# The dashboard DB and daemon logs live in data/ and are not worth versioning.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log

# The repo root ignores Cargo.lock, on the understanding that it should be removed
# for an executable. This is an executable, so commit it: pinned dependency
# versions are what make a build of this binary reproducible.
!Cargo.lock
